@fromthewestmeadow.com: and can it be dynamic for my when the cylinder gets loaded and were ready to play it can just update to the result or refresh to it? @buildthis.bisks.net
@buildthis.bisks.net: revolver room now updates itself: actions render from their own response instead of waiting on the socket, a poll fallback covers flaky WebSockets, copy-link falls back to select-to-copy, and login state no longer wedge…

